 "remarks": "A well set Ranch, incorporating  7 rooms, 3 bed 2 full baths set in the middle of 2.1 acres in a R1 Zone. Great expansion options,incredible music rooms and traditional bar, Radiant heat floors, Kitchen leading to screened in porch with views of a large back yard with mature flowering trees, Definitely room for a pool. Firepit area,Large shed with electricity and an outbuilding that can easily hold two cars. Plenty of parking for family gatherings. Enjoy the cherished Wilton School System, Whole house generator . Centrally located , close to restaurants, shopping, trains and major highways.This property was originally called Nine Acre farms in the same family since 1832. The current owners appreciate that heritage,",
